---
const total = 28799;
const groups = (
  [
    ['Republican primary', 10262],
    ['Democratic primary', 9398],
    ['General election only', 6666],
    ['No primary history', 2473],
  ] as const
).map(([name, count]) => ({
  name,
  count,
  percent: `${Math.round((count / total) * 1000) / 10}%`,
}));
---

<section class="early-vote" aria-labelledby="early-vote-title">
  <h2 id="early-vote-title">Early voting</h2>
  <p>
    Through October 30: 28,799 ballots, 27,611 in person and 1,188 by mail.
    The party lines are earlier primary records of those voters, not votes for a party on this ballot.
    Someone who has voted in both primaries is counted with the party of the most recent one.
    Secretary of State report updated November 2 at 10:05 a.m.,
    <a class="text-link" href="https://turnout.transparencyusa.org/2026-general/county/bastrop/" rel="noopener">posted by Transparency USA</a>.
    The county results file still shows no ballots.
    <a class="text-link" href="https://www.bastropvotes.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Press-Release_Election-Results.pdf" rel="noopener">The elections office</a>
    will release early-voting totals after the last voter has voted.
  </p>
  <ul>
    {groups.map((group) => (
      <li>
        <span>{group.name}</span>
        <strong>{group.count.toLocaleString('en-US')}</strong>
        <em>{group.percent}</em>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ul>
</section>

<style>
  .early-vote { margin: 0 0 1.4rem; }
  .early-vote h2 { font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.6vw, 2rem); border-top: 4px solid var(--ink); padding-top: 0.55rem; }
  .early-vote p { max-width: 46rem; margin-top: 0.45rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .early-vote ul { list-style: none; margin: 0.8rem 0 0; padding: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 0.8rem; }
  .early-vote li { border-top: 3px solid var(--ink); padding-top: 0.45rem; }
  .early-vote span, .early-vote em { display: block; font-style: normal; font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .early-vote strong { display: block; font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 1.45rem; font-weight: 620; line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0.15rem; }
  .early-vote em { margin-top: 0.15rem; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
  @media (max-width: 800px) { .early-vote ul { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
</style>
